  "brain_first": "“先别写第一句，把题目要求拆成三个小任务。”",
  "sort_order": 1060,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2526
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "题目给身份、对象、情境和2-3个内容要点。",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2527
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2528
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Task fulfilment：是否完整回应题目要求。",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2529
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先别写第一句，把题目要求拆成三个小任务。”",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2530
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 漏一个内容点往往比少一个高级词更伤。",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2531
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2532
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 圈身份：你是谁？写给谁？",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2533
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 圈目的：邀请/感谢/建议/申请/介绍等。",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2534
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 把每个内容点编号①②③。",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2535
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 每个编号至少安排一句核心句。",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2536
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5 最后再决定开头和结尾。",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2537
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 先列任务点，不写句子：身份 | 目的 | point1 | point2 | point3 | reply。每完成",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2538
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "一点打 ✓。",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2539
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2540
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 题目要求“介绍+原因+期待” → 三块都必须出现",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2541
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 若要求“自荐承担任务” → 必须明确说你愿意做，而不是只夸自己",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2542
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 草稿上每个题目要点都有对应句。",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2543
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 不会高级表达时，先用最简单正确句把要点写完。",
      "sourcePage": 92,
      "sourceIndex": 2544
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2545
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "题目：给交换生介绍社团并邀请参加。草稿先写：①club does what ②time/place ③why worth joining",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2546
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "④ask for reply。",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2547
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2548
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 写得很长却漏点。",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2549
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 没看清写信对象导致语气不合。",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2550
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2551
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 要点全吗？",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2552
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 身份和对象对吗？",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2553
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： W-M 漏任务点｜W-R 对象/语域不合适｜",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2554
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "W-T 时态｜W-V 动词形式｜W-S 拼写｜W-O 组织不清。",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2555
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2556
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 应用文先完成任务，再美化语言。",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2557
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2559
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 邀请邮件题干有活动、时间、地点、回复要求，草稿列几项？",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2560
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 作文先写高级开头还是任务点？",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2561
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 给老师写求助，Can you help me? 是否可以更得体？",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2562
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 漏一个要点但句子很高级，是否值得？",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2563
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 写完第一轮检查？",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2564
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 至少4项全部列出并打勾。；2. 任务点。；3. 可用 Could you please... / I would appreciate...；4. 不",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2565
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "值得，完整优先。；5. 任务点是否全部覆盖。",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2566
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— PW1 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“PW1”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 93,
      "sourceIndex": 2567
    }
  ],
